OL,3,GNEWSACordon lifted after 'suspicious
OL,4,Aitems' destroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are returning home following
OL,7,Fthe evacuation of 153 properties, after
OL,8,Fpolice discovered "suspicious
OL,9,Fsubstances and items" during an arrest.
OL,11,FThe Explosive Ordinance Disposal Unit
OL,12,Fwas called to Becket Road in Worle,
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare, on Wednesday and a
OL,14,F100-metre (328ft) cordon was set up in
OL,15,Fthe area.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police arrested a man
OL,18,Fin his 70s on suspicion of fraud by
OL,19,Ffalse representation. The items were
OL,20,Ffound during a subsequent search of the
OL,21,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
