OL,3,GNEWSACordon lifted after 'suspicious
OL,4,Aitems' destroyed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say the items have since been
OL,7,Fdestroyed, adding: "We would like to
OL,8,Fextend our sincerest gratitude to the
OL,9,Fresidents and their loved ones for
OL,10,Ftheir patience".
